Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.30,0:00:03.82,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah, of course. I still cannot believe{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N当然 我还是不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.82,0:00:07.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}that I'm doing a press conference with a Grand Slam trophy by my side.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N带着大满贯奖杯开发布会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:11.88,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it's been one of my biggest dreams in my life.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一直是我人生最大的梦想之一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:15.96,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And I'm just super happy that I was able to give my best{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N很开心我能拼尽全力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:17.70,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and win the match and win this tournament.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赢下比赛 赢下这个赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:19.65,TL,,0,0,0,,去年错过单打年终
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.65,0:00:21.86,TL,,0,0,0,,今年拿下第一座大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.86,0:00:24.74,TL,,0,0,0,,安德烈耶娃终于拿到那张门票
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.74,0:00:28.24,TL,,0,0,0,,但这一年 并不是一路赢过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.59,0:00:29.74,TL,,0,0,0,,阿德莱德决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.74,0:00:32.17,TL,,0,0,0,,她从{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}开始连赢{\fs78}9{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.17,0:00:34.23,TL,,0,0,0,,拿下赛季首冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:43.96,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's Andreeva's title in Adelaide.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N安德烈耶娃在阿德莱德夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:49.18,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A ruthless demolition job on the world number 17.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对世界第{\fs78}17{\fs68}的彻底压制
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.06,0:00:51.80,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Mboko was struggling physically,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而姆博科身体状况不佳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.28,TL,,0,0,520,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but she has been well and truly put to the sword.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但她也被对手彻底击溃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.61,0:00:57.65,TL,,0,0,0,,澳网止步第四轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.65,0:00:59.27,TL,,0,0,0,,接下来的四站硬地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.27,0:01:01.70,TL,,0,0,0,,她也都没能走到四强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.01,0:01:05.00,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}月的林茨 决赛首盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:07.64,TL,,0,0,0,,她连扳两盘 逆转波塔波娃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.64,0:01:09.33,TL,,0,0,0,,拿下第二冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.69,0:01:12.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}For the second time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二次冠军点机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.81,0:01:20.89,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The top seed, the world number 10,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N头号种子 世界第{\fs78}10{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.89,0:01:27.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}has just been able to claim her fifth WTA title.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拿下了第五座{\fs78}WTA{\fs68}冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.29,0:01:33.73,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And how hard that Andreeva has had to work,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N安德烈耶娃付出了多少努力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.73,0:01:35.97,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}not just today, but throughout the week.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不仅今天 更是整个星期
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.51,0:01:41.19,TL,,0,0,0,,马德里再进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.19,0:01:43.41,TL,,0,0,0,,却两盘负于科斯秋克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.41,0:01:46.29,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次 奖杯属于科斯秋克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.29,0:01:49.28,TL,,0,0,0,,可两人的故事 还没结束
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.53,0:02:09.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A spectacular display of dialed-in determination{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N极其专注而坚定的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.83,0:02:12.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}yields a new queen of the clay in Madrid.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N成就了马德里新红土女王
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.20,0:02:14.07,TL,,0,0,0,,到了巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:16.51,TL,,0,0,0,,她先在半决赛击败科斯秋克
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.51,0:02:18.61,TL,,0,0,0,,再战胜赫瓦林斯卡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.61,0:02:20.60,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}19{\fs68}岁 首夺大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.60,0:02:23.64,TL,,0,0,0,,她一直以来的梦想成为现实
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.75,0:02:41.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The teenager becomes a champion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这位少女成为了冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.32,0:02:56.22,TL,,0,0,0,,本季至今 红土{\fs78}22{\fs68}胜{\fs78}3{\fs68}负
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.22,0:02:58.54,TL,,0,0,0,,草地却只有{\fs78}1{\fs68}胜{\fs78}2{\fs68}负
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.54,0:02:59.96,TL,,0,0,0,,温网先赢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.96,0:03:02.73,TL,,0,0,0,,她仍被克雷吉茨科娃逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:06.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Krejcikova has earned herself another match point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N克雷吉茨科娃又拿到赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.15,0:03:26.21,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's that net cord again{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又是这次擦网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.21,0:03:28.51,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}that does for Andreeva.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N让安德烈耶娃败下阵来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.51,0:03:31.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The former champion inspired and helped{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这位前冠军再次受到鼓舞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.71,0:03:34.97,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}by Centre Court once again.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N并得到中央球场的助力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.30,0:03:37.34,TL,,0,0,0,,美网 她拿到两个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.34,0:03:39.20,TL,,0,0,0,,却没能拿下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.20,0:03:42.57,TL,,0,0,0,,高芙完成逆转 她止步八强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.89,0:03:45.39,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Second match point now for Gauff.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在是高芙的第二个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:12.55,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}9{\fs68}日
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.55,0:04:16.02,TL,,0,0,0,,官方确认她首次获得单打年终资格
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:17.92,TL,,0,0,0,,去年错过的那张门票
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:20.49,TL,,0,0,0,,今年不用再等到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:23.78,TL,,0,0,0,,两天后 她在北京决赛收获亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.78,0:04:26.48,TL,,0,0,0,,随后首次升到世界第{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.22,0:04:28.01,TL,,0,0,0,,她回顾
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.01,0:04:31.09,TL,,0,0,0,,今年和团队更注意参赛与休息
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.09,0:04:33.28,TL,,0,0,0,,去年错过的单打年终门票
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.28,0:04:35.11,TL,,0,0,0,,今年终于属于她
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.11,0:04:36.53,TL,,0,0,0,,首次单打年终
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.53,0:04:38.93,TL,,0,0,0,,你期待她走到哪一步？
